      "options": {
        "code": {"language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false},
        "content": "**In an incident:** find the root. A halted service names its cause and runbook (recovery). A paused\nservice names the root it waits on (root_service, cause). Fix the root; the pauses clear by themselves.\n\nThe full board of service states, with the records of services that stopped, is the JSON-RPC method\n`kardamom_chainStatus` on any ingress. Each service also serves its halt at `/halt` on its metrics port.\nRunbooks: `docs/runbooks/<cause>.md`. Set the DA-lag budget variable to the deploy's\n`KARDAMOM_DA_LAG_BUDGET_BLOCKS` (default 10000): no metric exports the budget.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this page",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {"collapsed": false, "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9}, "id": 8, "panels": [], "title": "Service states", "type": "row"},
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "Each service instance: running, paused or halted. A halt has priority over a pause.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {"text": "running", "color": "green", "index": 0},
                "1": {"text": "paused", "color": "yellow", "index": 1},
                "2": {"text": "halted", "color": "red", "index": 2}
              }
            }
          ],
          "custom": {"cellOptions": {"type": "color-background"}},
          "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 10},
      "id": 9,
      "options": {"showHeader": true},
      "targets": [
